      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WHISKEY WHISKERS (8) stalked the lead from a middle draw and boxed on well to finish 5 lengths back in third (34.56) at this track in a Grade 4/5 over 595m. Comes through a solid form race last start. Good form should continue. LAKEVIEW IAN (3) was below best at his last start when 6th at The Meadows following a win (32.76) at Traralgon two back. Has the ability to give this a shake. PAW FORTRESS (1) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing fifth (42.65) in a Grade 4/5 at this track. Has a strong winning record here. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings five times from seven attempts. Has ability and can atone. LOCHINVAR HUMMER (7) is a last start winner who can measure up again.",
